39
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Hey, so, can you make it on Friday?
嘿，那週五你能來嗎？

40
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:25,000
What? Oh, yeah, yeah, I think so.
什麼？噢，是的，是的，我也這麼認為。

41
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Why am I invited to this again?
為什麼我又被邀請參加這個活動？

42
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Yeah, apparently Albert has no friends.
是的，阿爾伯特顯然沒有朋友。

43
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Oh. He's very excited about the bachelor party, though.
哦。不過，他對單身派對感到非常興奮。

44
