真的嗎？謝謝。

177
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:44,000
Listen, Joey, we definitely want to see you for the call back on Saturday.
聽著，喬伊，我們絕對希望在週六的回電中見到你。

178
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,000
Excellent.
出色的。

179
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:46,000
LAUGHTER
笑聲

180
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:47,000
